<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#consilientWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#sheep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group of sheep standing in a line with their rear ends facing forward, their woolly butts prominently displayed. Two children are visible sitting atop the sheep's backs. This image is commonly used as an internet meme."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#metaphoricallyMapsTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
