<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#terrorism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The use of violence or threats of violence to intimidate or coerce governments, organizations, or populations, often for political or ideological purposes. The meme uses the real-world concept of terrorism to create a harmful stereotype by associating it with sexualized and vulgar behavior, which is both inaccurate and dehumanizing. This association is offensive and contributes to a hostile environment by normalizing harmful attitudes against a specific group."@en .
