<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on harmful stereotypes by associating ISIS with sexualized, vulgar, and inappropriate behavior, which is not only inaccurate but also dehumanizing and potentially inciting hatred or violence against a specific group. The combination of visual elements (men in traditional attire, exaggerated expressions) and the text creates a toxic and harmful message that targets a specific community based on their association with a terrorist organization, making it a clear example of harmful content."@en .
