<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#dehumanization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process of stripping away the humanity of a group or individual, often by portraying them as less than human or as objects. The meme relies on dehumanization by associating ISIS with sexualized and vulgar behavior, which is both inaccurate and harmful. This association is offensive and contributes to a hostile environment by normalizing harmful attitudes against a specific group."@en .
