<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#juxtaposition_of_images> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image is divided into two parts: the top half shows sheep with their butts facing forward, and the bottom half shows men in traditional attire reacting with exaggerated shock. The juxtaposition creates a humorous and satirical effect, implying a scenario that is both absurd and offensive."@en .
