<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01236#toxic_content> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Content that is harmful, offensive, or damaging to individuals or groups, often by promoting hatred, prejudice, or violence. The meme is an example of toxic content because it relies on harmful stereotypes and dehumanization to create a satirical and offensive scenario. This content contributes to a hostile environment by normalizing harmful attitudes against a specific group."@en .
